  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddee98d193248a121500dc3c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥！\n在这大舞台也绝不让出第1名\n为我们展现了完美的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb61a9139728d3e8f36f5eee3d56f5da98622bd1c313fffdbc55fa8a3154a981",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:809dc2da15e945e988e8167d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "大树快车！\n她那与生俱来的速度与力量\n为我们展现了一场豪迈的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52631083bf35d7571b998aab34b39c2e7718d692c3e705cf52f235e06c605de0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee54bb680f3437248149f50c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "草上飞！\n朝着顶点勇往直前的大和抚子\n如今成为了当之无愧的俊杰",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd466618874baf5c50315e752fc692f4592971b2c0b983e8382a7814db614002",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b45a185a5d223383ed962a8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊！\n在所有比赛中所表现出的强大而凛然的姿态\n正可谓女杰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7713ffa583df587d3d566cff636d0958e3a3d96a0769a860c3a716e4aeec34d8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0552e5161cc6ecd67c55807",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆！\n胸怀着背负豪门之名的觉悟\n为我们展现了坚强而美丽的名伶的奔跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "715eb90ae25db7a52510cb00002cac50e8b8468fbb3a6643392c7145540baac1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4ee5ef302b0a7b82b36306a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "神鹰！\n在最前方飞驰的怪鸟\n为我们展现了能在世界展翅翱翔的最强奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77ec643f0e5cddd3520f594a1b8eea83f645cdb94f27502828f067f67c367c9a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aef9d932aa6b08fb5a2fc5e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "好歌剧！\n她那征服所有赛马娘不断取胜的身姿\n正可谓世纪末霸王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb09efebad466578fa253825141d0ebdc5b9d271017b5ba136855bc1c098fef6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccedaef7fe25f8dd65d4ab23",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "成田白仁！\n她的奔跑只能称之为最强\n简直如同怪物一般！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25ac2ed236b0daa0f399e95d3895a9e7dc1ebb49a33d4918aea08deb438973ce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54528d3ffca8cbbcb5bb722a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征！\n用完美的奔跑向我们\n展现了她那皇帝君临的自豪感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d86158c1174449811613f23b80c1534a33a0890ee00f243ae4e1cbd317f76ffa",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a61cda1bed358b54103711d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "气槽！\n以出色的奔跑为我们\n展示了女帝所追求的理想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f05d1a727097716d213e8562135f53183c0fa5bd912cf751f5bf987e168d7775",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f639d1082c9841782f0d7872",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "爱丽数码！\n跨越无数战场的身影\n正是勇者的姿态！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b3ac4bcbed6bb123f968287c74c372ca68487335aff19e6075c91710141c754",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f56528861dfc3f7307cbec4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "青云天空！\n如晴空漂浮的云朵一般无法触及的身影\n不愧为诡术师！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bb8eedd4d0421dd5f2e43ccbfed30dc4f00ea39000b78e701b2aa2296b10257",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f33ed7b8fe406f77349cb40d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "玉藻十字！\n如闪电一般划过赛场\n为我们展现了她惊人的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5977ad38aa4f36cb602763aad5198a44800121e3aeb4b448dbae7b84c3c167fc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5316250a9f2303bdf9829b5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势！\n胜利是无可替代的荣光\n她在名为比赛的世界中将其纳入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5f26d5e64101f37238bef2faa02c71919689fde56759d26d0865b17f7276279",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88271f14ba1cf71126f0477",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光！\n将「胜利的方程式」构筑完毕\n于此证明了她世代最强的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e62b4d877afb2c1c01767d14e81cf3049324ae059057a47c4c6ead92aca3db2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0431bdc22a24515e9c8c0935",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮！\n发挥她那罕有的才能\n为我们展现了一场天衣无缝的最强奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58bb1aa3c5188ac87ac997ac85b05cb85cea143abd662b1af09bce49c13366b8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83717c3cdeac0f0e8be4ce61",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "曼城茶座！\n以划破漆黑般的奔跑\n证明了她立于摩天大楼顶点的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba140b94391f4ea7531784b24c5dae2d3f21167f0f614839033c50fc9938dbf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a00ece0898bc51085bb5b58e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "美浦波旁！\n如赛博格般精确无比的奔跑\n为我们展现了她极致的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44f745b8e3ec1a8a616e27f1efdbd4f31e0f1b14bc5acabeed4c929c61c67c9e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d71fc9480b9c4c5d03687c2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩！\n无愧于豪门之名的决心与磨练的力量\n她以强而有力的奔跑将其证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61190039df49a9a9d1a1c5b667295260cfc4300a827b46e74680780adef4f730",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d42cae351a036756375c3454",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "菱曙！\n她那庞大身躯的奔跑\n也斩获了巨大的荣耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e854972810e65bd1dc381acb81c6f317b371dacb302572558cc1aee871ea190",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ce356771a0100eab6c4b7c6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "雪之美人！\\n在这场令她接近自己梦想的精彩比赛之中，\\n展现了独她一份的不屈精神！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a70f5399240c7a268d86c1448a42192190f5a355037547a21521e6f78bab8e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27e2377285d731af61b78474",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "米浴！\n在怎样的大舞台中都贯彻自我的奔跑\n她正是最强的英雄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "004370100f757784c498b8d4fc53c1ebedd1c33bee86e187e35d229194e8e21f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b62d64de27d501ab0a79d516",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神！\\n她以狂风般的奔跑\\n成功摘下桂冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "972724b1d2abe58df223b1e2f305b3010917c3af5633575e2f475dc0faccd1d3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0eb6a5ccb28b23bcb56d751",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子！\n她那如梦幻般的超光速奔跑\n将我们的梦想变为了现实！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e66874254ce5bd36feb512e8dbe7632ee26664844d9c42ab135343e037a9349",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b44ab543fcdcda05e4a44798",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬！\n怀着比所有人都强烈的觉悟\n为我们展现了与一等星之名相符的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96794faef8b88e27653d92dbe66cd3141fa199db53375eae8a0775dad9357d0a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e376aa66d091d2d1bd4a9455",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "稻荷一！\\n用她那潇洒的奔跑\\n让我们见识到了什么才叫天下无双的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6d0a03b2fb421290c53e4971998d98ff2167a0f2affc547d2ea5b8b39a8e30c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a923bde4ef822b913a27b76",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券！\n在大舞台中以强烈的信念\n展现出了她那作为世代旗手的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d5fb3e9cb7689ee52e590fc8bf27b1ee3e8f8e462431c944b98a3daad5825",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7ef7d4a5ccac1126f9fd85",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "空中神宫！\\n以自己推导出的逻辑\\n证明了其最强的奔跑之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a28989e918e56d98e073f82f86c9cac88e2e7f4de844e82379e5c97d6944f7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bdd47f57a69be0ba157d798",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "荣进闪耀！\n胸怀自豪与意志\n呈现了一场以自我为宗旨的完美比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d39b4cd5c698e43c02b9079921975660211eb8e8b8cae71bc10c68066f1d7e1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:827a4f2e25c626690e7fe6e0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "真机伶！\n以闪光般的速度\n呈现了一场令所有人都为之心动的精彩比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32f1aa6979cc3f4fd1cc4387e112fc2b5a2a6dc28416882987e6bda4503ef268",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e276051a34b9dd7832d0609",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "川上公主！\n成功打败劲敌\n斩获了公主之证的精彩胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b27c6e376dcf01291e99bc422f18ace7bb475cbc36de07fa80992132cc1fa03",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e0e909ee65a3ca02a35d2dc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "黄金城市！\n以绝不动摇的意志和自己双腿\n证明了她为比赛赌上一切的强烈意志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "870b9363282b4df9792c64626461077ba80089cb75eb091da9e9f8c8ef8fc299",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddde242c45fcad7f86e73fcb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "樱花进王！\n她那突飞猛进般的奔跑\n爆进王之称果然名不虚传！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11f64521f4e9984cdbde1380ea992863ac1faa20d1835245fcbf976b36c438fb",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ee0015f90e1885620505a9d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "采珠！\\n她展现出了世界级水平的奔跑\\n证明了自己的自信与可能性！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baa80e7c62c0db22a26c87cf5242c0f6ec4b19eb6f046c5da77f4731dd007a3a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:452a1f956f2ed7f459ed97aa",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "新光风！！\\n她的斗争心熊熊燃烧，\\n在我们的心中留下鲜明的咬痕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae4800fe3fe3dcda8fa858d1d4d140b07c566581b812cd436718871e73dd618",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:180b7de69007983bdcf7dae0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "东商变革！\\n一瞬之间爆发出锋芒\\n为我们展现了魔法般的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a532848cfddb51e3903f6c51ffc74f45ba2f3ebda21aa167a5823160c832ce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d2106e730ad76e07ce9a00",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "超级溪流！\n她用与生俱来的才能与敏锐\n证明了自己领先一切对手的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81371bf152853994e5c12428bf7784d2ffd95c402d7bedb1c3e437226fd030c3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:664124132e3770c4d8345f70",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰！\n将观者视线集于一身\n成功登上了顶峰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa0b270d6c968f74918ae077f94243fdeb5b8129534f1127c367f0829716bc29",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36289b55da2d71117e9e171f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄！\\n如英雄一般勇敢奔跑取得了胜利\\n如同扮演了精彩故事的主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af47ff18555c135c7b7a03f28888b98ab62a6136b1fd00d3c84f261019e57085",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca2472109d65f19ae184524",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "东瀛佐敦！\n以绝不动摇的好胜之心\n为我们展现了无可撼动的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e98649425a168a8046c3abfeede3655e84b4dad92ae1d50419d88516d8458b20",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ca2cdb4fcb8d863907291d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "中山庆典！\\n展现出将一切赌在那一瞬机遇之中的灵魂奔跑\\n精彩地赢下了对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae113addcbd5844e1c765653650545e3952994fef93678ee55cac98e3d04323d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4177d45f2f15f538776ed3cf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "成田大进！\n充分展示了她那世代第一的速度\n在这大舞台上正面了自己的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac35c0c96c23444014b0638ce942d44338b4e57f22faaafc7372823fb217589a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bea864829f95906a9dc7f33",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "西野花！\\n她以可爱且给人以勇气的奔跑\\n令巨大的花朵绽放了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f24a89f25ac1e01fc3e07132ff71a40f95b8479c6d48aae43aa44de9821567",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dddb54f2667df3ae7fdba6ed",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "春丽！\n她以永不言弃的不屈精神斩获冠军的身影\n真可谓春光烂漫！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc5b8c6b65fc245a6fdf6e361432cc9d50c30fb7339e399aa6bd0ce8c4ee17b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac726379f1ac75f5ca08e05",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "青竹回忆！\\n她着凭自己勇往直前向梦想全力冲刺的精神，\n在这场强敌云集的比赛中胜出！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba885a49f500e810091251e14cb29181bbb7c614bdd7af66eb050f94a409966",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e369578b20778eea1c33ae9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "美丽周日！\\n她为我们带来了惊喜与感动\\n那出色的跑法正可谓是Marvelous！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7445401c3d1e8d55b533997e839d8ed8146f87fe5511916d4fa2d343cba37fce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1b8424bd563e90e2ddb446",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "待兼福来！\n她用坚信自己实力的奔跑\n成功将“福”招“来”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb94ca93730bd52edb9cfd60f962983655e53e90ddd3ccf8c40b81ced712709",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c5c1aef52f2ca759d8f94e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "千明代表！\\n她凭借着无拘无束的天真烂漫的跑法\\n展现出了压倒性的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "343103ec28a5e6b5d537f61e8fb79bf68fbae8f5e63ea777093ff0f6e3a59c62",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:005fc524241dc5f8c1a7556a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛！\n胸怀萌生的自信\n斩获了超越霸王的最佳成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "123a1477585dc4757dc3430ae2d4fd11060edf251e76b2a20bb0c84d53b25340",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:411a7679668154b405161fe8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白多伯！\n怀着名门马娘的坚强意志\n为我们展现了精彩的奔跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "62b14281cc43d0b33dd3ef8e417cf8c930701d53b1ee2f5164e0d2e8313bc2ce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:041c7af6c1789a878f79c734",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "优秀素质！\n她那优秀的素质成功绽放\n斩获冠军，堂堂正正地回应了大家的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad4c6abd9b9f97d0b7d64a1953e9a604dabccc05f6ae34ce309e8b8fe3ce51d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6645030f185d3680f169b0ee",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "圣王光环！\n战胜众多强敌\n取得了不负圣王之名的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccd40c00d5864d75130b19a5ddcc7d1359e7970719790ae467b626ce665423d7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb900c0d7447986a4f9aa1c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧！\n发挥出她那与生俱来的专注力\n展现了足以回应粉丝呼声的出色奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4470dee10be333f91b804b8840547f2ae6b48ea4c19421600a5eb4c1021d0e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250bd30bead79f97dafeba72",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "生野狄杜斯！\\n以一颗卓越的克己之心参赛\\n为我们献上了诸多胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceecd8ec88d9737320b5673ff5f9993176f24f5605dbd23470ab727b848f2305",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb2464c0fa1d90697a23aefe",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白善信！\\n没有被豪门之名束缚，她那自由的领放姿态\\n铭刻到了我们的记忆之中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ccb08aba1d25035a7b37d2be7de9078e02d7749e0fc4085899f7bc6db7e57bd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc6e5974dca7429f34d7fb90",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "大拓太阳神！\\n她用那如烈日般无止境的光芒\\n在我们的心灵与胜利之间搭起了一座坚实的光之桥！",
      "source_fingerprint": "267c43a9ff79d403cea74940250381273e5093691ba9b595c22928acd2f73dde",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08fa355ae1f800d8bec31859",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "双涡轮！\\n她用尽浑身解数以爆领守住了领头位\\n成就了一番非凡功绩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0becfb0eab426f1d5b0e9f4b158824184333e8906bb680832e35fb3240cafb7b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1032a96eb55be92f17a474a4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "里见光钻！\n实现了被托付于身的期待与愿望\n用胜利为我们展现了自己前行的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1c00b7e1f5417ad7a59cebbcaff5bb79f603497cb442c7fd301c542c0f9c953",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee92e981bb97abb2a8fb668d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹！\n肩负着梦想与希望\n用胜利给予了我们喜悦和勇气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c74d76678c936b6c4f15db30e8c6e4b6a540871067aa56853e229108610908a3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14697efb555141775aaf69a0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王！\n一心一意努力开花结果\n成功令荣光之樱绽放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34f3d2eca932b465440d8363239c50e8cf16733a9b06e425e1ab14e792f49c1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3090"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cf29a86fbee17d70fe12b10",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征！\\n她用能够支撑起自己野心的最强跑法\\n证明了自己作为一等星的辉煌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2586a65a9b525585e9ab845c81a4e2c8148d43af0697fe4751a0cd271b0bc38a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d895176c1f44367613d01bf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹！\n她那脆弱，坚强而美丽的奔跑\n在这大舞台上放出了耀眼的光辉",
      "source_fingerprint": "327d4c5858d671182552295979d2c1ccc8a546727f72af3f57caf0be9e5d1267",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f2a20852b78d29f81dad689",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "八重无敌！\\n凭借自我磨炼出的武之精神与凛然的奔跑，\\n成功击败了一众豪强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca137bcb1a8eec0a2d9f7bec05cea5875be8f2d36b5fdd6680a1729dfd96035",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffd8c7a440572cb904ec4c22",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白光明！\n继承名门之威光，即便面对最强的对手\n也以绝不服输的奔跑斩获了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62a1a77ca612026494edcf7fc71ab91d34a5bb906021b3daceb63af3a78827ca",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:466fdceed7187c4ec0f2f7fb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "这将会是决出今年沙土中距离王者的一战！\\n希望她能够发挥出世界级的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57940e9a5d662a0a35927e0a8f3329f3b9d02df21c8df91730aaa983771eb1e0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a8e440e3b045f98769822dd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望她在这场船桥初夏的沙土英里赛事上，\\n能够成长为顶尖级的选手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2576f14f0b3a605324ff59f1748cac554e6ccf831b167f2d58a8cce793357c93",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:041447f70a9400f3ba6f3ff3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望她能驰骋在陆奥的长直道之上，\\n展现出不辱“沙土赛事代言人”之名的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42046d862332810ad1644cd26e686e41661104e38ba000cd165e05bc1ca83d0e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:187e0f17cb274b4572df82ec",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "这位选手的力量与速度天赋异禀，\\n也许明年能够成为担起整个沙土界的新星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71f9884a10432925eba5281d77e33df2479fa179d5f408bdcbcf2102cf70c552",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00e61f05dd9ef888bf3700d4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石！\\n怀揣身为华丽一族的骄傲\\n展现出绽放最耀眼光芒的精彩奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc0ef1d6df5d457ece45d5bd74960eb32a7c45caa021928ef900602c95f831dc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e8391e556fc80843b9d6f7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "吉兆！\\n以不负漆黑的帝王之名的精彩跑法\\n完成了赢得最重要胜利这项使命！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eda0bcbb29b00897dac15b8a1fe78b1e527f2e71c5e205be59d6ad019306d5a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc302f6b0acd47320c7706de",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠！\\n她凭借不屈不挠的心和秘藏于内的热情\\n让大朵樱花在这最大舞台上绽放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "133765fab4401bf6ab89cf76c5f0dc45e2571cb316269eda5a656875f9934448",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8f26f2b4127acd9e1f59454",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "新宇宙！\\n她展现出甩开所有选手的超常跑法\\n在这大舞台上取得了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd8308d05ce6d388b26f994f7ab5cd43def23a98717807cfe16a4246c2ed52a8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dee97ddbdb8c5770119ec22",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "菱钻奇宝！\\n她展现出用绝不平凡的脚力来回应\\n热情的粉丝的奇迹般的跑法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95cbe10ed5fbeea3ed0d2718a4884ae752a3183463fdd61c0acef9f96a79865f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ed47449bc0a5e676d11386b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒！\\n她兼备了速度与力量的最强跑法\\n令我们沉醉其中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cafd9b029e207949be1727fb85ff149b454b96c8bf447a5af9f795517821a557",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac87a42ec9072c976e69619",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌！\\n她凭借那颠覆常识的气势昂扬的跑法\\n证明了自己正是一张王牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f465f8664a1758a815b015685b90bee6c3fb7808f6212d84f725ca51fb9b3b1d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:013f8dd8b987fc47d5cf09b8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "成田路！\\n经历漫长道路最终让自己成为了主角\\n以巨大胜利回应了粉丝的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a0956d6ff74af7fc0c9e45717b4dce24d4a43ff0030652a198a7160e0a2db2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:258a2c095d2754790bc81ae8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "也文摄辉！\\n以接近所憧憬的风的触及灵魂的跑法\\n在这个大舞台上掀起了波澜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5be8a74a0e426ed9bc6283dc3c43d7e0b16759e4a62ff2ace6a688c219be9c3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f186effe5789aabb52f074",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "真弓快车！\\n以可爱但又犀利的令人印象深刻的跑法\\n让我们见证一场足以弥留于心的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3587b59ea2e8349e55f770be5083cab3a446aef250b732435abe15f921ed6089",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d65d1fb7c6fa232f647ada9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "小林历奇！\\n以饱含自己信念以及理运的跑法\\n为我们带来了「Happy」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b7e69b3473dd33f8fb5943654bab0496c7ed7ab2d8f2346643f3c47ae7e6b6f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfde3371bb257288d75ca25e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "北港火山！\\n心怀对故乡・苫小牧的强烈心意\\n让我们见证一场立于前所未有之巅峰的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "344bc85c6f2e4337f342aeaf9238aeb31e3dc6f5fd891c8adeca8dfb941ac8e8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
